        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 9211, Outswing Door Security Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis steel security door latch protector is 11\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) on residential or commercial door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/outswing-door-stainless-steel-security-latch-guard-don-jo-lp-111-630\"><b>Stainless Steel Latch Guard</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-9211_size.gif?v=1704354519\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 9211 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 9211 Security Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 4 each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nuts and washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/9211.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 9211 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Outswing Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo 9211",
                "description": "Don-Jo 9211 door security plate. This steel security door latch protector is 11 inches high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) on residential or commercial door applications. Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with either  2-3/8 or 2-3/4 backset. ",
                "keywords": "DJO-9211 Outswing Door Security Plates, front Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo LP-211 latch protectors, Don-Jo 9211 door security plates, don-joe front Door Latch Guards, anti vandal plates, door Security plates, Don-Jo 9211-PC, Don-Jo 9211-DU, Don-Jo 9211-SL, Don-Jo 9211BP, Don-Jo 9211-CP"
